WEBVTT

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:14.200
Welcome to the night of Wonderland.

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:17.330
I am Cid, an inventor.

00:00:18.510 --> 00:00:21.710
According to Lisa, Kaze's Magun
can give birth to the energy of

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:26.950
special Summon Beasts through the
use of a driller and Soil bullets.

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:30.150
With the use of different kinds of Soil,

00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:32.590
he can supposedly summon
a variety of different beasts.

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:36.060
Oh, I'd love to see that sometime.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:43.000
There is also the vapor-like gas called Mist,
which produces energy through linear motion.

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:47.940
Then there are Elenium Condensers, which
extract energy from Wonderland water.

00:00:48.610 --> 00:00:52.480
Still others, like June and Nene,
extract energy from potatoes.

00:00:52.480 --> 00:00:53.750
And so on and so forth.

00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:56.380
There are many energies
in the world of Wonderland.

00:00:57.290 --> 00:00:59.050
Incidentally, our submarine, Jane,

00:00:59.050 --> 00:01:02.360
can not only travel at a top speed
which exceeds 500,000 peseta knots,

00:01:02.360 --> 00:01:05.850
but her attitude control nozzles installed on her
hull allow her to be piloted with incredible ease!

00:01:32.390 --> 00:01:38.190
Daichi ni sosogu yoake

00:01:32.390 --> 00:01:38.190
The light of dawn pours over the vast Earth

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:45.690
Tabidatsu toki wo tsugeru

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:45.690
And marks the beginning of our journey

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:54.800
Mirai wo mezashi kaketeyuku kaze

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:54.800
With our eyes on the future

00:01:55.280 --> 00:02:00.910
Kono mune ni suikonda

00:01:55.280 --> 00:02:00.910
I deeply breathe in the rushing wind

00:02:04.550 --> 00:02:10.550
Yume dake wo kizamitsuketa hitomi

00:02:04.550 --> 00:02:10.550
The eyes that could only speak in dreams

00:02:12.430 --> 00:02:18.060
Bokura ni yuku michi wo ataeru

00:02:12.430 --> 00:02:18.060
Presented us with the path we're to take

00:02:19.970 --> 00:02:23.770
Fly to the Neverland

00:02:19.970 --> 00:02:23.770
Fly to the Neverland

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:33.270
Kagiri nai yuuki wo mezamesasete

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:33.270
Awaken the unlimited courage inside of us

00:02:42.720 --> 00:02:46.250
Welcome to the sea of Wonderland.

00:02:48.460 --> 00:02:52.090
I am Fabula, your guide.

00:02:54.270 --> 00:02:56.130
Traveling deep through the sea,

00:02:57.340 --> 00:03:00.600
together with trusty comrades.

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:07.780
But Pist controls the Ocean Puzzle
to trap them

00:03:07.780 --> 00:03:11.550
and leads them into a maze
beyond any known dimensions.

00:03:12.820 --> 00:03:16.050
Don't give up, my courageous travelers.

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:26.890
Well then! Are you ready?!

00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:32.400
Please be sure to have fun in my
incredibly cool attractions!

00:03:51.990 --> 00:03:53.120
Where is this place?

00:03:53.800 --> 00:03:55.700
Have we landed on some island somewhere?

00:03:58.000 --> 00:04:00.160
Cid, what's going on here?

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:02.660
I have absolutely no clue.

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:06.370
We are trapped somewhere inside
a cube-shaped space!

00:04:06.370 --> 00:04:10.370
Maybe this is the cube from the Ocean Puzzle
that guy Pist told us about.

00:04:15.820 --> 00:04:17.680
We're on land!

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:19.920
There's no way we can move
forward like this, is there?

00:04:19.920 --> 00:04:21.620
What's going on?

00:04:24.130 --> 00:04:26.720
I've got a bad, eerie feeling about all this.

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:43.710
You guys...

00:04:44.750 --> 00:04:48.680
Must be very eager to escape
the sea of Wonderland.

00:04:49.550 --> 00:04:51.140
Is it a mermaid?!

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:52.620
It's huge.

00:04:53.050 --> 00:04:56.180
Who are you?! One of the Earl's henchmen?

00:04:57.060 --> 00:05:01.690
I am Somosan, one who loves wisdom.

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:04.760
Wisdom?

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:09.290
Now I will present you with riddles.

00:05:09.570 --> 00:05:14.740
For every question you answer right, I will take
you that much closer to reaching your goal.

00:05:16.280 --> 00:05:18.010
But for every time you guess wrong,

00:05:18.010 --> 00:05:22.780
you will move towards falling into
the endless darkness of Chaos.

00:05:23.450 --> 00:05:24.980
The darkness of Chaos...

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:27.420
How does that sound?

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:31.290
It's quite a peaceful solution, wouldn't you say?

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:33.090
Decide.

00:05:33.090 --> 00:05:37.670
Three among you must be chosen
to determine the fate of the group.

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:39.790
This is a trap. I'm sure of it!

00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:44.200
Yeah, but she's saying that she
doesn't want to fight, so...

00:05:44.840 --> 00:05:48.970
I'll do it! This too is a battle
for the sake of order!

00:05:49.710 --> 00:05:50.740
What about Kaze?

00:05:50.850 --> 00:05:51.900
No way.

00:05:52.010 --> 00:05:54.710
He doesn't seem the least bit smart to me.

00:05:55.820 --> 00:05:59.050
Just for safety's sake, Cid, we'll
have you stay back here.

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:08.590
All right, you'll be going up
against the three of us!

00:06:10.730 --> 00:06:14.220
I can practically smell your intellects.

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:19.400
Hey, I heard you possess that
special Kigen Arts power.

00:06:19.740 --> 00:06:21.640
It's something that we can
use here, right?

00:06:22.240 --> 00:06:24.840
Well...

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:30.410
Is that kind of thing normal in the
world that you come from?

00:06:32.290 --> 00:06:36.420
Something about your smile
bothers me, you know.

00:06:37.730 --> 00:06:40.250
It looks like you're trying to hide something.

00:06:41.260 --> 00:06:43.430
Who shall go first?

00:06:43.430 --> 00:06:46.530
I will have each of you answer three questions.

00:06:47.270 --> 00:06:49.040
I'm going first!

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:50.900
I will solve any riddle you give me!

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:56.670
How promising.

00:06:57.550 --> 00:07:02.180
Let's begin! Time for the first question!

00:07:03.550 --> 00:07:05.140
In the beginning it has four legs.

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:06.650
Next it has two legs,

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:09.460
and in the end it has three legs.

00:07:09.460 --> 00:07:12.790
What living creature does this describe?!

00:07:13.690 --> 00:07:15.320
This riddle is...

00:07:15.960 --> 00:07:18.090
It's just a normal riddle?!

00:07:18.200 --> 00:07:21.760
Me, me, me! I know the answer to this one!

00:07:24.070 --> 00:07:27.710
I thought this was going to be difficult,
but this riddle is so simple.

00:07:27.710 --> 00:07:28.730
The answer is...

00:07:29.580 --> 00:07:31.640
A human!

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:34.410
In the beginning it is a baby crawling,

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:37.080
then it becomes an adult
who walks on two legs,

00:07:37.190 --> 00:07:40.380
and in old age he walks with
a cane for his third leg.

00:07:40.490 --> 00:07:41.980
How is that?!

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:47.090
Incorrect!

00:07:48.630 --> 00:07:51.830
The correct answer is the
Wonderland bacteria, Hemora!

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:56.830
What is that?!

00:07:56.940 --> 00:07:59.340
We don't know about that kind of stuff!

00:08:06.850 --> 00:08:10.380
We really are moving towards the
bottom of the puzzle, space and all!

00:08:12.650 --> 00:08:14.640
<i>This is the Ocean Puzzle.</i>

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:17.660
<i>We can only be saved by answering correctly!</i>

00:08:23.500 --> 00:08:24.770
You should be very afraid!

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:32.190
Every time you move down, your fear makes
Chaos stronger, and it moves the puzzle further!

00:08:33.310 --> 00:08:37.710
Moving on to the second question!

00:08:37.810 --> 00:08:39.680
What is quick to cry,

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:41.750
likes to sing and dance,

00:08:41.750 --> 00:08:44.080
and is always swimming in the ocean?

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:47.310
What is that?!

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:51.660
Of course I know this one!

00:08:51.660 --> 00:08:52.820
The answer is...

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:55.730
Something that is quick to cry,
sings and dances,

00:08:55.730 --> 00:08:59.170
it is the Wonderland fish, the Maimai!

00:09:01.740 --> 00:09:04.100
Incorrect!

00:09:04.640 --> 00:09:06.800
The correct answer is Ocean TV!

00:09:11.980 --> 00:09:13.410
We've fallen again!

00:09:13.510 --> 00:09:17.210
What is Ocean TV?! What is that?!

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:18.810
This quiz isn't fair at all!

00:09:19.520 --> 00:09:21.780
Knave, are you sure you've got this one?!

00:09:21.890 --> 00:09:23.120
Hang in there!

00:09:24.390 --> 00:09:26.860
For the third question,

00:09:26.860 --> 00:09:30.190
I will use all of the knowledge
I have attained in Wonderland!

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:32.960
And the third question!

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:35.460
This living creature runs on land,

00:09:35.570 --> 00:09:38.840
but its feet never touch the ground.

00:09:38.940 --> 00:09:40.430
What is it?!

00:09:42.840 --> 00:09:45.070
<i>I must be sure to think conceptually.</i>

00:09:47.520 --> 00:09:49.680
<i>Isn't it a car?</i>

00:09:49.680 --> 00:09:51.780
<i>Oh no, it couldn't be that. This is Wonderland.</i>

00:09:52.490 --> 00:09:54.610
<i>Oh, I've got it!</i>

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:57.390
The answer is the incredible
fast animal of Wonderland,

00:09:57.390 --> 00:09:59.190
the Bicharing!

00:10:01.300 --> 00:10:03.350
Incorrect!

00:10:04.070 --> 00:10:07.520
The correct answer is the driver of a car.

00:10:07.640 --> 00:10:09.970
What the heck?!

00:10:11.070 --> 00:10:12.300
Knave!

00:10:15.740 --> 00:10:17.510
Oops,

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:20.080
I forgot to tell you that whoever
answers all three questions incorrectly

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:23.850
will turn into a puddle of water, just like that!

00:10:28.190 --> 00:10:31.090
How's that?

00:10:31.090 --> 00:10:33.220
I'd be extra careful from now on.

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:35.490
Knave is...

00:10:35.600 --> 00:10:37.500
Is he dead?

00:10:40.430 --> 00:10:43.430
So who will be next?

00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:44.470
I will.

00:10:44.570 --> 00:10:47.940
No! I, the soldier Miles,
will be your next opponent!

00:10:48.480 --> 00:10:52.170
Well then, what a brave little girl.

00:10:52.810 --> 00:10:57.750
Thinking of your friends and
exerting yourself. How noble.

00:10:57.850 --> 00:11:00.550
Now, shall we begin?

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:01.880
Bring it on!

00:11:01.990 --> 00:11:03.320
The first question!

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:07.760
The second question!

00:11:11.000 --> 00:11:13.020
The third question!

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:31.150
Knave, Miles...

00:11:33.550 --> 00:11:36.110
It seems you are all alone now.

00:11:36.690 --> 00:11:39.460
It will all be over soon.

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:43.860
Once you fall, it will be to the bottom
of the darkness of Chaos.

00:11:44.530 --> 00:11:46.970
You will never rise from it again.

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:48.870
Chaos...

00:11:49.370 --> 00:11:51.000
The bottom of darkness?

00:11:51.770 --> 00:11:57.840
It looks like the next question
will decide all of your fates.

00:12:00.210 --> 00:12:02.680
Lisa! You can do it!

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:04.220
Don't lose!

00:12:08.690 --> 00:12:13.460
And now, the question!

00:12:21.100 --> 00:12:25.470
Wow! I hope that cute one
gives us a good show.

00:12:25.810 --> 00:12:28.470
These guys aren't any good at all.

00:12:28.910 --> 00:12:33.050
Look at me. I've gotten all
the questions right so far.

00:12:33.050 --> 00:12:35.640
I could have guessed that,
Your Excellency.

00:12:35.720 --> 00:12:37.680
You're the quiz king of Wonderland.

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:42.220
They are all common sense
questions about Wonderland.

00:12:42.790 --> 00:12:45.220
If they don't know the answer
to such easy questions,

00:12:46.630 --> 00:12:50.760
they are not worthy of
living in Wonderland.

00:12:53.170 --> 00:12:54.690
Incorrect!

00:12:55.400 --> 00:12:57.560
Incorrect!

00:13:03.740 --> 00:13:04.940
Lisa!

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:07.810
If you get the next one wrong, we're going to
drop into the bottom of the darkness!

00:13:11.490 --> 00:13:14.150
At last it is time for the final question.

00:13:14.990 --> 00:13:17.010
A face is growing from
the middle of its hair.

00:13:17.120 --> 00:13:18.520
When it drinks water, it breathes fire.

00:13:18.630 --> 00:13:20.800
Some say it looks like a living creature
and some say it looks like a machine.

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:22.850
What is it?!

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:28.970
Give me your answer!

00:13:31.570 --> 00:13:32.970
Do you know it?

00:13:33.470 --> 00:13:34.770
She doesn't know.

00:13:36.440 --> 00:13:38.000
Come on, come on!

00:13:38.710 --> 00:13:40.040
Well...

00:13:40.150 --> 00:13:42.050
Come on, come on, come on!

00:13:46.990 --> 00:13:48.780
What an ugly face.

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:55.790
Don't think you can trick me and
get out of this with that smile.

00:13:57.260 --> 00:14:00.360
Wait! Give me a little more time!

00:14:00.900 --> 00:14:02.840
I'm putting all my thoughts together.

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:04.800
Please, just a little longer.

00:14:05.310 --> 00:14:09.780
Lisa! Quit trying to avoid the issue
by laughing and take this seriously!

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:14.080
Sis, Lisa is just trying to buy a little more time!

00:14:16.020 --> 00:14:19.380
<i>Yeah, that's right. I am always...</i>

00:14:22.090 --> 00:14:23.850
<i>Mom!</i>

00:14:33.430 --> 00:14:36.200
<i>Even though it was to help the town...</i>

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:41.040
<i><i>If you use your life spirit recklessly,</i></i>

00:14:41.040 --> 00:14:43.030
<i>you'll end up like me.</i>

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:44.980
<i>Mom!</i>

00:14:45.550 --> 00:14:48.050
<i>Don't forget this!</i>

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:52.110
<i>The Kigen Arts are always on your side.</i>

00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:58.480
<i>A brave heart will always find
the energy to save others.</i>

00:14:59.790 --> 00:15:03.320
<i>So let me see you laugh.</i>

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:18.380
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:24.280
<i>You must never forget that smile, Lisa.</i>

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:32.950
<i>Mom...<i></i></i>

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:38.930
<i>Mom... Hey, I'm laughing.</i>

00:15:40.940 --> 00:15:45.840
<i>Hey, Mom, say something.</i>

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:50.540
<i>Mom...</i>

00:15:54.180 --> 00:15:59.210
<i>After that I moved to the neighboring country.</i>

00:16:00.120 --> 00:16:04.260
<i>Even though I was surrounded there
by unfamiliar settings and people,</i>

00:16:04.260 --> 00:16:07.460
<i>I protected myself by always
putting on a false smile.</i>

00:16:10.700 --> 00:16:12.670
<i>That is why this smile is fake.</i>

00:16:13.330 --> 00:16:16.500
<i>It's a big lie that I only use when I'm in trouble.</i>

00:16:17.400 --> 00:16:23.210
Come! Time is almost up!

00:16:24.240 --> 00:16:27.110
<i>What should I do? Mom...</i>

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:29.080
Don't laugh.

00:16:30.720 --> 00:16:31.950
Kaze!

00:16:32.790 --> 00:16:34.250
Since when?!

00:16:34.360 --> 00:16:36.980
No way, does Mister think he's
going to answer the quiz?!

00:16:40.130 --> 00:16:41.990
None of it means anything.

00:16:43.560 --> 00:16:44.660
Meaning?

00:16:47.330 --> 00:16:49.800
Really? I see.

00:16:50.770 --> 00:16:54.260
It is just like the camouflage that I use.

00:16:54.810 --> 00:16:57.900
Looks like you can't come up with an answer!

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:01.840
No.

00:17:03.180 --> 00:17:05.980
There were never any answers,
to any of the questions.

00:17:06.590 --> 00:17:08.020
That's my answer!

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:14.260
You're just putting together words
that make no sense,

00:17:14.260 --> 00:17:17.290
and no matter what we answer, you have
no intention of saying it's correct.

00:17:18.230 --> 00:17:20.830
All of your questions are just tricks.

00:17:22.800 --> 00:17:25.200
No one has ever been able to answer...

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:26.900
Lisa...

00:17:27.010 --> 00:17:28.500
Awesome!

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:31.740
I've won! Now release our submarine!

00:17:33.650 --> 00:17:37.640
The day I lose is the day this cube is destroyed.

00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:41.850
I'm going to take you all down with me!

00:17:44.060 --> 00:17:45.620
You've tricked us, haven't you?!

00:18:02.440 --> 00:18:05.440
<i>If they are lives you want to protect at all costs...</i>

00:18:06.010 --> 00:18:09.110
<i>If it is for their sake, I won't stop you.</i>

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:14.210
<i>I won't stop you from using the spirit of your life.</i>

00:18:18.630 --> 00:18:20.220
<i>The spirit of the rushing water...</i>

00:18:24.260 --> 00:18:27.560
<i>I will transform my life into spiritual energy.</i>

00:18:53.760 --> 00:18:56.660
<i>I'm sorry, Ai, Yu.</i>

00:18:57.360 --> 00:19:03.770
<i>I thought I would be able to help you until
you were reunited with your parents, but...</i>

00:19:04.570 --> 00:19:07.870
<i>I'm sorry. I'm sorry.</i>

00:19:21.860 --> 00:19:23.290
Lisa!

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:26.150
Thanks to you, we were able
to come back to life.

00:19:27.030 --> 00:19:28.220
Lisa!

00:19:28.900 --> 00:19:31.230
I'm still alive?

00:19:32.030 --> 00:19:34.130
Even though I used the spirit of my life?

00:19:35.200 --> 00:19:37.940
The spirit of your life probably reacted with

00:19:37.940 --> 00:19:41.640
the water of Wonderland to give birth
to a huge energy source.

00:19:41.740 --> 00:19:44.010
It was like a Summon beast.

00:19:44.110 --> 00:19:46.550
If it comes from you, we have to
call it a Kigen Dragon, right?

00:19:48.080 --> 00:19:50.110
I'm just so glad that you are all okay!

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:52.120
Thank you.

00:19:53.620 --> 00:19:55.020
What? That laughing face!

00:19:55.960 --> 00:19:58.650
See, I knew you could laugh for real.

00:19:58.860 --> 00:20:00.490
It looks much better!

00:20:02.500 --> 00:20:03.690
What about Kaze?!

00:20:04.130 --> 00:20:05.160
He's with us!

00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:06.890
Look, he's over there.

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:23.050
So you've cleared the first stage, have you?

00:20:23.550 --> 00:20:27.450
Let's move right along then!

00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:31.020
Start the second stage!

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:36.500
And now the journey begins

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:36.500
Soshite tabi wa hajimaru

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:40.100
Just the two of us going off

00:20:36.550 --> 00:20:40.100
Kimi to futari doko ka e

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:43.650
Trance Euro Express passes through the night

00:20:40.150 --> 00:20:43.650
Trance Euro Express hashirisaru

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:47.250
Riding into the distance

00:20:43.700 --> 00:20:47.250
Toorisugiru yakei ni

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:50.750
Let me hear more of your heart

00:20:47.300 --> 00:20:50.750
Motto kokoro kikasete

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:54.400
Let me close my eyes and be intoxicated

